      "en": "### Colour Input\n\nred ｜ blue ｜ yellow ｜ colour ｜ same colour ｜ red one ｜ blue one ｜ yellow one ｜ touch red ｜ show me blue ｜ find yellow\n\n### Number Input\n\none ｜ two ｜ three ｜ number ｜ count ｜ one more ｜ give me one ｜ give me two ｜ give me three ｜ count with me ｜ clap one ｜ tap two ｜ step three\n\n### Action and Routine Input\n\nlook ｜ touch ｜ point ｜ show ｜ give ｜ take ｜ put ｜ match ｜ sort ｜ clean up ｜ wait ｜ your turn ｜ all done\n\n### Teacher Routine Language\n\nLook. ｜ Touch red. ｜ Point to blue. ｜ Show me yellow. ｜ Give me one. ｜ Give me two. ｜ Let’s count. ｜ One, two, three. ｜ Put it here. ｜ Same colour. ｜ Clean up. ｜ All done. ｜ Good job.",
